{"sha": "4c806423d4242edce5df392e1af68829cac9d2109d4daf790d9816cd953f5c65", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:8}", "遮盖法：$\\dfrac{1}{k(k+1)(k+2)} = \\dfrac{1/2}{k} - \\dfrac{1}{k+1} +", "\\dfrac{1/2}{k+2}$。改写为裂项相消的差：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{k(k+1)(k+2)}", "= \\frac12\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{k(k+1)} - \\frac{1}{(k+1)(k+2)}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "（展开验证 --- 或将两个分解式相减）。求和：", "\\[", "S_n = \\frac12\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{1 \\times 2} - \\frac{1}{(n+1)(n+2)}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac14 - \\frac{1}{2(n+1)(n+2)}", "\\xrightarrow[n \\to \\infty]{} \\frac14 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:9}", "对 $0 \\leq m \\leq n - 1$，分解分式 $\\frac{X^m}{P}$", "（次数 $m - n \\leq -1$，极点皆为单极点）：由单极点公式得", "\\[", "\\frac{X^m}{P} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{x_i^m / P'(x_i)}{X - x_i} .", "\\]", "乘以 $X$ 并令 $X \\to +\\infty$：左边趋于", "$X^{m+1}/P$ 的极限，其值为 $0$（当 $m \\leq n - 2$ 时），为 $1$（当 $m =", "n - 1$ 时）（$P$ 为 $n$ 次首一多项式）；右边趋于", "$\\sum_i \\frac{x_i^m}{P'(x_i)}$。因此", "\\[", "\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{x_i^{m}}{P'(x_i)} =", "\\begin{cases}", "0 & \\text{对于 } 0 \\leq m \\leq n-2,\\\\", "1 & \\text{对于 } m = n - 1,", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "上式包含了题中所述的两个恒等式（$m = 0$ 要求 $n \\geq", "2$）。（借助\\cref{thm:b1:poly:lagrange}可作如下解释：这些和式是", "$X^m$ 的 Lagrange 插值多项式的首项系数，而", "次数 $\\leq n-1$ 的多项式在 $n$ 个点上插值，", "恰好还原该多项式。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:10}", "形如 $\\frac aX + \\frac b{X+1} + \\frac c{(X+1)^2}$。遮盖法：在", "$0$ 处 $a = 1$；在二重极点处：$c = \\bigl[\\frac1X", "\\bigr]_{X=-1} = -1$；由 $xF(x)$ 在无穷远处的极限得 $0 = a + b$，故", "$b = -1$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{X(X+1)^2} = \\frac1X - \\frac1{X+1} - \\frac1{(X+1)^2} .", "\\]", "对 $n = 1, \\dots, N$ 求和：前两项裂项相消，得到", "$1 - \\frac1{N+1}$，第三项贡献 $-\\sum_{k=2}^{N+1}", "\\frac1{k^2}$。令 $N \\to \\infty$，并利用 $\\sum_{k\\geq1}", "\\frac1{k^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n(n+1)^2}", "= 1 - \\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi^2}6 - 1\\Bigr) = 2 - \\frac{\\pi^2}6", "\\approx 0.355 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:11}", "在变量 $Y$ 中：$\\frac1{(Y+1)(Y+4)} = \\frac{1/3}{Y+1} -", "\\frac{1/3}{Y+4}$（分别在 $-1$ 与 $-4$ 处遮盖），故", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{(X^2+1)(X^2+4)}", "= \\frac13\\,\\frac1{X^2+1} - \\frac13\\,\\frac1{X^2+4} .", "\\]", "同理 $\\frac{Y}{(Y+1)(Y+4)} = \\frac{-1/3}{Y+1} +", "\\frac{4/3}{Y+4}$，故", "\\[", "\\frac{X^2}{(X^2+1)(X^2+4)}", "= -\\frac13\\,\\frac1{X^2+1} + \\frac43\\,\\frac1{X^2+4} .", "\\]", "（在 $X = 0$ 处检验：$0 = \\frac13(-1 + 1)$。）这些已经是", "实分解：不可约二次式上的分子", "恰好都是常数。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在避开极点的每个区间上，$F'(x) = -\\sum_i", "        \\frac{c_i}{(x - p_i)^2} < 0$，于是严格递减。当 $x", "        \\to \\pm\\infty$ 时各项都趋于 $0$，故 $F \\to 0$，", "        在 $+\\infty$ 处从上方趋近（此时各项皆为正），在", "        $-\\infty$ 处从下方趋近。当 $x \\to p_i^+$ 时，", "        $\\frac{c_i}{x - p_i}$ 趋向 $+\\infty$，其余各项", "        保持有界，故 $F \\to +\\infty$；类似地，$F \\to -\\infty$（当", "        $x \\to p_i^-$ 时）。", "  \\item 固定 $\\lambda > 0$。在 $\\intoo{-\\infty}{p_1}$ 上：$F$", "        从 $0^-$ 递减至 $-\\infty$，故 $F < 0 < \\lambda$，", "        无解。在每个 $\\intoo{p_i}{p_{i+1}}$（$1 \\leq i", "        \\leq r-1$）上：$F$ 从 $+\\infty$ 递减至 $-\\infty$，", "        故恰取值 $\\lambda$ 一次（由介值性质及", "        严格单调性）。在", "        $\\intoo{p_r}{+\\infty}$ 上：$F$ 从 $+\\infty$ 递减至", "        $0^+$，同样恰有一个解。总计恰有 $r$", "        个解，且与极点相互交错。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:fractions:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 遮盖法：$\\frac1{X(X+1)} = \\frac1X - \\frac1{X+1}$。", "求和后裂项相消：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\Bigl(\\frac1n - \\frac1{n+1}\\Bigr)", "= 1 - \\frac1{N+1} \\longrightarrow 1 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\frac1{X(X+2)} = \\frac{1/2}X - \\frac{1/2}{X+2}$.", "求和时，$\\frac1n$ 项在 $n = 1, 2$ 时保留，而", "$-\\frac1{n+2}$ 项在 $n = N-1, N$ 时保留：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\frac1{n(n+2)}", "= \\frac12\\Bigl(1 + \\frac12 - \\frac1{N+1} - \\frac1{N+2}\\Bigr)", "\\longrightarrow \\frac34 .", "\\]", ""]}